        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;strokeColor=#879196;fillColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45'&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;SEAL Hackathon — AWS Architecture v3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Status: &lt;b&gt;Proposed&lt;/b&gt; · Revision 2026-11-24 · Drawn by: BE1 · Reviewed by: BE2 (pending)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend:&lt;/b&gt; solid = runtime flow · dashed = deploy / config / alert / redrive · dotted = association. Arrows show the request direction; responses return on the same connection.&lt;br&gt;Client side = browser running the React SPA; server side = everything inside AWS Cloud.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;①&lt;/b&gt; Browser → CloudFront over HTTPS. Route 53 answers DNS; AWS WAF is the web ACL attached to CloudFront. · &lt;b&gt;②&lt;/b&gt; Static files from private S3 (OAC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;③&lt;/b&gt; /api/*, /oauth2/*, /login/oauth2/*, /uploads/* → ALB → Auto Scaling group, not cached; ALB sticky sessions for OAuth. ALB → EC2 HTTPS 8443 with an instance certificate (decision D-01 pending)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;④&lt;/b&gt; SQL over TLS (VERIFY_IDENTITY) · &lt;b&gt;⑤&lt;/b&gt; Files through the S3 Gateway Endpoint · &lt;b&gt;⑥&lt;/b&gt; Outbound via NAT: GitHub source fetch, OAuth token/user info, SES SMTP&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑦&lt;/b&gt; Send AI job (outbox) · &lt;b&gt;⑧&lt;/b&gt; SQS triggers Lambda · &lt;b&gt;⑨&lt;/b&gt; Read input, write result · &lt;b&gt;⑩&lt;/b&gt; Model call · &lt;b&gt;⑪&lt;/b&gt; Send result · &lt;b&gt;⑫&lt;/b&gt; Poll result, commit to DB, then delete the message&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑬&lt;/b&gt; Email · &lt;b&gt;⑭&lt;/b&gt; OAuth sign-in (browser redirect; callback through CloudFront) · &lt;b&gt;⑮&lt;/b&gt; CI/CD: 15a push image → 15b sync web → 15c deploy → 15d run script → 15e pull image&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑯&lt;/b&gt; Secrets: Lambda reads Parameter Store; API EC2 reads it through the deploy script started by Run Command (15d) · &lt;b&gt;⑰&lt;/b&gt; Alerts by email&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Both API instances share the same connections; arrows are drawn once from AZ A. Contest season: RDS Multi-AZ, 2 API instances, NAT Gateway in AZ B (faded icon and path). Off-season: Single-AZ RDS, 1 instance, 1 NAT.&lt;br&gt;CloudWatch also collects logs and metrics from Lambda, RDS, ALB and SQS. Security groups: ALB ← CloudFront prefix list only; EC2 ← ALB only; RDS ← EC2 only; Lambda runs outside the VPC.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="1400" x="20" y="1700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rl_note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DD344C;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rate limits (outbound calls)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑩ DeepSeek API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5 jobs/judge/h, 20/day; 300 jobs/event/day&lt;br&gt;≤60k input, 4k output tokens per job&lt;br&gt;Same SHA + rubric + prompt version reuses the stored result&lt;br&gt;Backoff on 429; stop when balance is out&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑥ GitHub API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;GITHUB_TOKEN (5,000 req/h); fetch each SHA once&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑬ Amazon SES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 OTP/min and 5/h per address&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;⑭ OAuth&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WAF rate rule on /oauth2/*, /login/*" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="760" width="200" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
